  "body": "Tucked away beside the Weiti River, right in the heart of Red Beach, 13 Te Awa Place is one of those rare finds that gives you space to breathe without leaving the neighbourhood you actually want to live in. Picture long summer afternoons around the pool and spa, kids and grandkids racing across the lawns, a vege garden that actually gets used, fruit trees ready to pick, and quiet mornings looking out towards the river. There's room here for the boat, the campervan and everyone you love, and still that feeling of having a little world of your own.\r\n\r\nOur sellers created this home so multiple generations could live close without living on top of each other. The substantial five-bedroom family home is joined by a fully self-contained legal minor dwelling, with a rental appraisal of $475 - $525 per week. Welcome family, host guests, or let that extra income help pay the way - and live the way that works for you.\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n* Solid, single level living, built by Generation Homes in 2018.\r\n* Five generously proportioned bedrooms, including four with private ensuites\r\n* Fully self-contained legal minor dwelling, with a rental appraisal of $475 - $525 per week\r\n* Central kitchen with large walk in pantry and convenient boiling water tap.\r\n* Ducted air conditioning and heating throughout for year-round comfort.\r\n* Inviting swimming pool and spa - perfect for family fun and relaxation.\r\n* Double garage for the main house plus a single garage for the minor dwelling.\r\n* North-facing outdoor living spaces soaking up all-day sun.\r\n* 3,008sqm freehold section complete with vegetable gardens and fruit trees.\r\n* Ample parking for cars, campervan, boat, and more.\r\n\r\nRed Beach puts the Hibiscus Coast lifestyle on your doorstep - the shoreline, Orewa's cafes and shops, and everyday amenities at Silverdale are all close at hand, yet coming home still feels like a retreat. This is a property for the family who wants room to grow, space to gather, and a place everyone is happy to come back to.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 10th December from 3:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/1LEN\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
